{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06536","headline":"杂诗二首 二 · 储光羲","name":"杂诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋气肃天地，太行高崔嵬。\n猨狖清夜吟，其声一何哀。\n寂寞掩圭荜，梦寐游蓬莱。\n琪树远亭亭，玉堂云中开。\n洪崖吹箫管，玉女飘颻来。\n雨师既先後，道路无纤埃。\n鄙哉楚襄王，独好阳云台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}